                    <p>天猫【颐莲旗舰店】</p><p>颐莲 · 氨基酸洁面乳 100g*2 支日常售价 79.9 元，下单官方限时补贴 54 元。</p><p><span class="font-color-red"><strong>点击详情页【9 折券】卡片</strong></span>，领美妆洗护 9 折券，立减 2.59 元。</p><p style="text-align: center;"><img height="325" src="https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/7/d3a7592f-752b-45ac-8bf0-bff5a79cc799.png" title="福瑞达亲儿子：颐莲氨基酸洁面乳 20.9 元淘宝双重补贴（商超 39.8 元）" width="1245" /></p><p>再点击详情页【大额抵扣】卡片，淘金币可抵扣 2.39 元。</p><p style="text-align: center;"><img height="161" src="https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/10/bde0236f-529b-45f8-9052-495cda779a2a.png" title="福瑞达亲儿子：颐莲氨基酸洁面乳 20.9 元淘宝双重补贴（商超 39.8 元）" width="1139" /></p><p>到手价为 20.92 元：</p><dir><a contenteditable="false" href="https://uland.taobao.com/coupon/edetail?e=fa0Ue5xl7XylhHvvyUNXZfh8CuWt5YH5OVuOuRD5gLJMmdsrkidbOWBzzpT26idJli8V9OiOv%2B46acMQvZT%2BAucDSX%2BYEAI4sBOjxAGaLKd%2BpokhYUfR8RnS%2FR%2FmD78MRSHvQe2jOLYrN%2FpcOxmvJM5vWfGj0IGEawvDoeqYhH3bxaWLmO75iAN017Ezus%2F%2FDfqEFBOhTcxf9phLmO%2F%2FZtRwNzjT8sA8qYiruubwBvmsOydTmprGTCd7LpBaMSAYwlq7eoeSbnFXpSIOywAC7f%2FI6j2lu5VAl8SlxnzaPt3pMnGeSCmTvXLoWjIFR8c6VW6yqqeGJ%2FI%3D&amp;traceId=2150430617911039416222803e0c75&amp;&amp;union_lens=lensId:TAPI@1791103941@213f7ce5_1ee6_1a1061d3c43_12d3@01" target="_blank"><span class="card main-site"><span class="card-logo"><img height="640" src="https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/10/793156df-c293-4f0c-b763-c5aebaaa664e.jpg" title="福瑞达亲儿子：颐莲氨基酸洁面乳 20.9 元淘宝双重补贴（商超 39.8 元）" width="640" /></span><span class="card-info"><span class="card-title"><span class="mall-data">天猫</span><span class="card-name">颐莲 氨基酸洁面乳</span></span><span class="card-abstract"> 100g*2 支</span><span class="card-controls"><span class="price">双重补贴 20.92 元</span><span class="card-btn-deep">直达链接</span></span></span></span></a></dir><p style="text-align: justify;">线下商超日常售价为 39.8 元 2 支：</p><p style="text-align: center;"><img height="695" src="https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/1/84ad32b9-2d22-4886-9737-dc0b820859c2.jpg?x-bce-process=image/format,f_auto" title="福瑞达亲儿子：颐莲氨基酸洁面乳 20.9 元淘宝双重补贴（商超 39.8 元）" width="1205" /></p><p>如果清洁剂的配方为“清洁剂是 2 个氨基酸 + 1 个甜菜碱 + 1 个葡糖苷”，用料不错 + 性价比高。</p><p>“颐莲”是山东福瑞达旗下品牌，近年来口碑不错：</p><blockquote><p>山东福瑞达医药集团有限公司是以医药和化妆品为核心业务，产学研相结合、科工贸一体化的健康产业集团，<span class="accentTextColor">是中国透明质酸（玻尿酸）产业的领跑者</span>。</p><p>公司每年投入 1~2 亿研发资金，成立了 550 人的研发团队，建有国家企业技术中心、院士工作站等 3 个国家级和 12 个省级平台：<a href="http://www.fruida.com.cn/Home/News/index/id/1627.html" target="_blank">点此查看官网</a>。</p></blockquote><p style="text-align: center;"><img height="1080" src="https://img10.360buyimg.com/imgzone/jfs/t1/106121/38/13279/148695/5e578651E511014be/6b1bbb82b0ea43bc.jpg" title="福瑞达亲儿子：颐莲氨基酸洁面乳 20.9 元淘宝双重补贴（商超 39.8 元）" width="790" /><img height="1043" src="https://img10.360buyimg.com/imgzone/jfs/t1/89529/28/10712/223424/5e1d30e1E49326dfb/435bd46f7d37a0fa.jpg" title="福瑞达亲儿子：颐莲氨基酸洁面乳 20.9 元淘宝双重补贴（商超 39.8 元）" width="790" /></p><dir><a contenteditable="false" href="https://uland.taobao.com/coupon/edetail?e=fa0Ue5xl7XylhHvvyUNXZfh8CuWt5YH5OVuOuRD5gLJMmdsrkidbOWBzzpT26idJli8V9OiOv%2B46acMQvZT%2BAucDSX%2BYEAI4sBOjxAGaLKd%2BpokhYUfR8RnS%2FR%2FmD78MRSHvQe2jOLYrN%2FpcOxmvJM5vWfGj0IGEawvDoeqYhH3bxaWLmO75iAN017Ezus%2F%2FDfqEFBOhTcxf9phLmO%2F%2FZtRwNzjT8sA8qYiruubwBvmsOydTmprGTCd7LpBaMSAYwlq7eoeSbnFXpSIOywAC7f%2FI6j2lu5VAl8SlxnzaPt3pMnGeSCmTvXLoWjIFR8c6VW6yqqeGJ%2FI%3D&amp;traceId=2150430617911039416222803e0c75&amp;&amp;union_lens=lensId:TAPI@1791103941@213f7ce5_1ee6_1a1061d3c43_12d3@01" target="_blank"><span class="card main-site"><span class="card-logo"><img height="640" src="https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/10/793156df-c293-4f0c-b763-c5aebaaa664e.jpg" title="福瑞达亲儿子：颐莲氨基酸洁面乳 20.9 元淘宝双重补贴（商超 39.8 元）" width="640" /></span><span class="card-info"><span class="card-title"><span class="mall-data">天猫</span><span class="card-name">颐莲 氨基酸洁面乳</span></span><span class="card-abstract"> 100g*2 支</span><span class="card-controls"><span class="price">双重补贴 20.92 元</span><span class="card-btn-deep">直达链接</span></span></span></spa